{"id":"vod_lz_51734","vodId":"51734","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"俗·再见，绝望先生","name_cn":"俗·再见，绝望先生","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230224-1/4bd90927bd92e3bb855b72d4f5b94b3d.jpg"},"summary":"无论什么方面都很普通的少女日塔奈美假扮成不上学少女来到学校，却发现学校满是怪人。超乐观少女风浦可符香无论看什么都乐观积极；一板一眼死硬派少女木津千里在“不上学少女为何来学校”这一点与奈美纠缠不清；连班主任糸色望都不上课，忙着自杀。一直认为“普通这个词肯定不是好话”的普通少女奈美，在教室中反倒成了另类。　　的确，在被称为“绝望先生”的超消极老师糸色望的带领下，2年へ班全体32人都是有一点儿不正常的人。口头禅是“绝望了！对xx的世界觉悟了”的望，与学生们一起生活的爆笑校园喜剧就这样再次开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-02-24 20:14:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4161_ca34f28f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4162_56bb1745/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4163_2e0e5700/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4165_2cb8f37c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4166_d5d7687d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4164_9d937b2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4169_bfe692da/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4168_d698ab5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4167_1bc26b6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4170_e09cd02b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4171_12bae927/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4172_a6b26bbc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4173_eb0fca7c/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:00.033Z"}